 # Changelog
 
+## 2.0.0 (unreleased)
+
+### Removed
+
+- `parse_loose`, deprecated in 1.9.0. Callers get an `AttributeError` naming the replacement: `parse` with
+  `YYYY-MM-DD` dates.
+
 ## 1.9.2
 
 - `format_iso` no longer pads years below 1000 twice.
